.Dd June 06, 2026
.Os Linux
.Dt MPSEEK 1 LOCAL
.Sh NAME
.Nm mpseek
.Nd seek within current song in mploop music player
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm mpseek
.Ar seconds
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm mpseek
is a tool to seek within the current song in the
.Xr mploop 1
music player.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "seconds"
.It seconds
The number of seconds to seek, either forward (positive) or back (negative)
.Sh "EXIT STATUS"
.Nm mpseek
exits with zero exit status for success. If there's an error such as
invoking
.Nm mpseek
with unsupported command-line arguments, it returns with a nonzero
exit status.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Nm mpseek
uses the following environment variables:
.Pp
.Bl -column HOME -compact
.It Ev HOME Ta the home directory of the user
.El
.Sh "SEE ALSO"
.Xr mploop 1
.Sh HISTORY
.Xr mploop 1
was created in September to November 2023. It has been maintained since.
.Sh DISTRIBUTION
.Xr mploop 1
is available at https://github.com/jmtilli/mploop
.Sh BUGS
Seeking for a huge number of seconds in a totally massive song can be slow.
